          "caption": "cache-asideの最小の形（説明用）",
          "code": "def get_product(product_id):\n    cached = cache.get(product_id)\n    if cached is not None:\n        return cached          # ヒット\n    product = db.load(product_id)  # ミス\n    cache.set(product_id, product, ttl=300)\n    return product"
